Allocation tables for 2021-2025 and 2027-2030 allocation periods

34A

1

The UK ETS authority must compile a table (an “allocation table”) for the 2021-2025 allocation period and the 2027-2030 allocation period as soon as reasonably practicable after approval under Article 16b of the Free Allocation Regulation of the final annual number of allowances to be allocated in respect of installations—

a

in the case of the allocation table for the 2021-2025 allocation period, in respect of which a deemed application for free allocation in the 2021-2025 allocation period (as defined in Article 2(19) of that Regulation) is made;

