as soon as reasonably practicable after approval under Article 16b of the Free Allocation Regulation of the final annual number of allowances to be allocated in 2027, compile an allocation table for the 2027-2030 allocation period which contains entries for the 2027 scheme year only; and

b

as soon as reasonably practicable after approval under Article 16b of the Free Allocation Regulation of the final annual number of allowances to be allocated in the 2028, 2029 and 2030 scheme years, update the allocation table for the 2027-2030 allocation period to include entries for the 2028, 2029 and 2030 scheme years.

