the installation identifier used in the registry;

b

subject to paragraph (1A), for each scheme year in the allocation period, the final annual number of allowances to be allocated in respect of the installation for the scheme year, in 3 columns as follows (see article 34B)—

i

column A (standard free allocation);

ii

column B (new entrants' reserve);

iii

column C (total).

