article 6 of the 2025 Order applies without the modification set out in paragraph (6) so as to require the final annual number of allowances to be allocated in respect of the installation for the 2026 scheme year to be calculated and approved for the purpose of inclusion in the entry for the installation in any updated allocation table in accordance with article 34C(1)(k) without the need to set out that the figure is provisional;

