Where an emissions report submitted to the regulator under paragraph 11(2)(b) is accompanied by a declaration referred to in paragraph 11(2)(b)(ii) (and is not verified as satisfactory in accordance with the Verification Regulation 2018), in the Monitoring and Reporting Regulation 2018—

