Duty to monitor reportable emissions, etc.

5

1

Where an installation is an ultra-small emitter for a scheme year, the operator of the installation must monitor the installation's reportable emissions in the scheme year in accordance with the appropriate monitoring plan.

2

The appropriate monitoring plan is—

a

the monitoring plan approved in relation to the installation under ... the Monitoring and Reporting Regulation 2018 for the 2025 scheme year, including—

