End of ultra-small emitter status: ceasing to meet criteria

7

1

This paragraph applies where—

a

an installation is an ultra-small emitter for any of the 2021, 2022, 2023, 2026, 2027 and 2028 scheme years; and

b

the regulator considers that the installation's reportable emissions in any of those years (the “excess year”) exceed the maximum amount.

2

Subject to sub-paragraph (7), the regulator must, as soon as reasonably practicable, give a notice to the operator of the installation.

3

The notice must—

a

set out the grounds for the notice;

b

state that the installation is not an ultra-small emitter—

